# The streamstudio canvas editor's recovery file — what a stop (streamstudio stop / restart, Ctrl+C, a closed terminal) kept of the
# unsaved work, written into the folder it served: `.streamstudio-workspace.json`, the `.broken.json` a discard
# moved aside, and the `.writing.json` it is written through. Per machine and per session: never committed.
.streamstudio-workspace*.json

# The editor's built page, streamstudio/canvas, is COMMITTED (README "Building the canvas page") — but never a source
# map: vite writes none (frontend/vite.config.ts), and one made by hand (`vite build --sourcemap`) stays local.
/streamstudio/canvas/**/*.map
